WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.975
Find the saved public site at 1 William Street, Brisbane.

00:00:03.975 --> 00:00:08.788
The coordinate lookup returns indicative region B1. Regional speed follows the selected design return period.

00:00:08.788 --> 00:00:11.190
Inspect a 700 m radius and switch true-north sectors. The three distance bands describe the viewing area.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:14.369
The imagery service is unavailable in this recording. Terrain is left unassessed in each band.

00:00:14.369 --> 00:00:17.518
Read the approach speed and velocity pressure, then the building-face case and net windward wall pressure.

00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:20.244
For illustration, enter an engineer-selected uniform TC2 for NE. Review exposure and fetch before design.

00:00:20.244 --> 00:00:23.756
The sector multiplier feeds the wind case. Review the remaining sectors, building geometry and pressure coefficients.
